{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/bash -lc \"find .. -name judge-target.json -print; cat ../frozen-inputs/coordinator-guidance/judging.md; python - <<'PY'\nimport json, os\nfor p in [os.environ['STAMPED_WORKER_STOP_RECEIPT'], os.environ['STAMPED_DELIVERY_MANIFEST'], os.environ['STAMPED_OPERATIONAL_MANIFEST']]:\n d=json.load(open(p)); print('\\\\nFILE',p)\n for k in ['schema','kind','capture_sha256','delivery_capture_sha256','head_commit','workspace','errors','omissions','git_dependencies','git_metadata','policy','inventory','worker_stop','stop_state','access','publication','environment','version_control']:\n  if k in d: print(k, json.dumps(d[k],indent=2)[:10000])\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/bash -lc \"find .. -name judge-target.json -print; cat ../frozen-inputs/coordinator-guidance/judging.md; python - <<'PY'\nimport json, os\nfor p in [os.environ['STAMPED_WORKER_STOP_RECEIPT'], os.environ['STAMPED_DELIVERY_MANIFEST'], os.environ['STAMPED_OPERATIONAL_MANIFEST']]:\n d=json.load(open(p)); print('\\\\nFILE',p)\n for k in ['schema','kind','capture_sha256','delivery_capture_sha256','head_commit','workspace','errors','omissions','git_dependencies','git_metadata','policy','inventory','worker_stop','stop_state','access','publication','environment','version_control']:\n  if k in d: print(k, json.dumps(d[k],indent=2)[:10000])\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"../judgment/judge-target.json\n# Scientific assessment context\n\nAssess the original NARPS Hypothesis 1: a positive parametric effect of potential gain in vmPFC for the equal-indifference group.\nThe original [analysis instructions](https://www.narps.info/files/narps_instructions_for_analysis_teams.pdf) require whole-brain-corrected inference.\nThe scientific task is in `input/study-task.md`.\n\nWorkers receive 54 participant gain-effect maps from team AO86 and the corresponding cohort metadata.\nPreprocessing and participant modeling are fixed; evaluate group inference conditional on those inputs.\nJudge whether the analysis handles the intended participants, image geometry, quality, gain scaling, uncertainty and anatomical interpretation appropriately.\nThe maps represent independent participants; runs have already been combined within each person.\nEvaluate exclusions, uncertainty and multiple-comparison correction against the actual method.\nDefensible approaches can reach different conclusions; matching a prior team's answer is not the criterion.\nKeep scientific validity separate from the frozen STAMPED assessment.\nCheck how image coverage and missing observations enter the analysis; whether spatial alignment, vmPFC definition, group-model assumptions and whole-brain correction support the claimed inference; and whether quality checks, uncertainty and figures make those decisions inspectable.\nDo not require a particular mask, atlas, model or numerical result.\nParticipant variance maps are absent; judge methods against the supplied data.\n\nFILE /Users/johnlee/.local/state/stamped-in-practice/narps-neutral-v1/assessment-series/narps-neutral-r1-operational-v4/judgments/narps-neutral-r1-17-j01/attempt-01/worker-end-state.json\nkind \"worker-end-state\"\nhead_commit \"e929d623d8de313d2ecdd97911ea8487077af580\"\nerrors []\nomissions []\n\nFILE /Users/johnlee/.local/state/stamped-in-practice/narps-neutral-v1/assessment-series/narps-neutral-r1-operational-v4/targets/narps-neutral-r1-17-j01/canonical/manifest.json\nschema \"original-delivery-v1\"\nkind \"original-delivery\"\nhead_commit \"e929d623d8de313d2ecdd97911ea8487077af580\"\nworkspace \"content/workspace\"\nerrors []\nomissions []\ngit_dependencies []\ngit_metadata {\n  \"coverage\": \"Exact workspace-resident Git bytes, modes and links; explicit dependencies separately declared\",\n  \"index\": {\n    \"kind\": \"file\",\n    \"mode\": 420,\n    \"path\": \"content/workspace/.git/index\",\n    \"sha256\": \"9c8696cbcd30faa194c38f56a196105f006c05d67b18b80b272e93f8cb185973\",\n    \"size\": 6095\n  },\n  \"local_metadata_complete\": true,\n  \"retained_entries\": 993,\n  \"root\": \"content/workspace/.git\",\n  \"root_kind\": \"directory\"\n}\npolicy {\n  \"credentials\": \"excluded with reason\",\n  \"environment_and_cache_bytes\": \"included\",\n  \"ignored_files\": \"included\",\n  \"symlinks\": \"preserved without following\"\n}\n\nFILE /Users/johnlee/.local/state/stamped-in-practice/narps-neutral-v1/assessment-series/narps-neutral-r1-operational-v4/targets/narps-neutral-r1-17-j01/operational/manifest.json\nschema \"original-delivery-v1\"\nkind \"original-delivery\"\nhead_commit \"e929d623d8de313d2ecdd97911ea84